B.Vz=new A.by(u.v,"Aisha (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6464")
B.VF=new A.by("Cleanliness is half of faith.","Abu Malik al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih Muslim 223")
B.Vn=new A.by("Whoever conceals the fault of a Muslim, Allah will conceal his faults in this world and the Hereafter.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699")
B.Vu=new A.by("The upper hand is better than the lower hand.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1427")
B.VM=new A.by("Make things easy and do not make them difficult; give glad tidings and do not repel people.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 69")
B.V_=new A.by("The best charity is that given when you are healthy and holding back, fearing poverty.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1419")
B.Vg=new A.by("Whoever does not show mercy will not be shown mercy.","Jarir ibn Abdullah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6013")
B.VL=new A.by("Kindness is never present in anything but it beautifies it.","Aisha (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2594")
B.V1=new A.by("Removing something harmful from the road is charity.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2989")
B.Vb=new A.by("A good word is charity.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2989")
B.VU=new A.by("Two words, light on the tongue, heavy on the Scale, beloved to the Most Merciful: SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahil-Adheem.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6406")
B.VS=new A.by("Whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day, let him honor his guest.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6019")
B.V3=new A.by("The most complete believers in faith are the best of them in character.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1162 \u2014 sahih")
B.VC=new A.by("Fear Allah wherever you are, follow a bad deed with a good one and it will erase it, and treat people with good character.","Abu Dharr & Mu\u2019adh (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1987 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.Vq=new A.by("Allah does not look at your appearances or your wealth, but He looks at your hearts and your deeds.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564")
B.Vo=new A.by("Leave that which makes you doubt for that which does not make you doubt.","al-Hasan ibn Ali (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2518 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.V8=new A.by("Part of a person\u2019s good Islam is leaving what does not concern him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2317 \u2014 hasan")
B.VB=new A.by("Do not envy one another, do not hate one another, do not turn away from one another \u2014 and be, O servants of Allah, brothers.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2559 \u2014 excerpt")
B.Vm=new A.by("A Muslim is the brother of a Muslim: he does not wrong him, nor forsake him, nor despise him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564")
B.Vy=new A.by("Whoever relieves a believer\u2019s distress, Allah will relieve his distress on the Day of Resurrection.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt")
B.VG=new A.by("Be in this world as if you were a stranger or a traveler.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6416")
B.VA=new A.by("If you were to rely upon Allah with true reliance, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds.","Umar ibn al-Khattab (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2344 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.VV=new A.by("Take advantage of five before five: your youth before your old age, your health before your sickness, your wealth before your poverty, your free time before your busyness, and your life before your death.","Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","al-Hakim \u2014 sahih")
B.VK=new A.by("The best among you are those who are best to their families, and I am the best of you to my family.","Aisha (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3895 \u2014 sahih")
B.Va=new A.by("He is not of us who does not show mercy to our young and honor our elderly.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1919 \u2014 sahih")
B.VJ=new A.by("The Merciful are shown mercy by the Most Merciful; be merciful to those on earth and the One above the heavens will be merciful to you.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4941 \u2014 sahih")
