B.V5=new A.by(u.d,"Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6412")
B.Vs=new A.by("Richness is not having many possessions; richness is contentment of the soul.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6446")
B.Vl=new A.by("The most beloved people to Allah are those most beneficial to people.","Ibn Umar (RA)","al-Mu\u2019jam al-Awsat \u2014 hasan")
B.VT=new A.by("Allah makes the way to Paradise easy for whoever travels a path seeking knowledge.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt")
B.VD=new A.by("When a man dies, his deeds end except three: ongoing charity, beneficial knowledge, or a righteous child who prays for him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 1631")
B.Vv=new A.by("The best of you in this world are those who, when they are reminded of Allah, their eyes overflow with tears.","Abdullah ibn Mas\u2019ud (RA)","Musnad Ahmad \u2014 meaning, graded hasan")
B.VW=new A.by("Whoever fasts Ramadan out of faith and hope for reward, his previous sins are forgiven.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 38")
B.Vh=new A.by("Whoever prays the two cool hours (Fajr and Asr) will enter Paradise.","Abu Musa al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 574")
B.VI=new A.by("The closest a servant is to his Lord is while he is prostrating \u2014 so make much dua.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 482")
B.Vt=new A.by("Allah descends in the last third of the night and says: Who calls upon Me that I may answer him?","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1145 \u2014 excerpt")
